Utility class for pattern matching used by IActivityListenerRegistration implementations.
Pattern Matching Rules: - Exact match: No wildcards → case-insensitive equality - Prefix match: Pattern* → name starts with pattern - Suffix match: *Pattern → name ends with pattern - Infix match: Prefix*Suffix → name starts with prefix AND ends with suffix - Match all: * → matches any name - Invalid: A*B*C → throws ArgumentException





